    description: 'A structured guide to swing highs and lows, Breaks of Structure and internal versus external structure, with reminders to test rules across sessions instead of assuming every break determines direction.',
    metaTitle: 'ICT Market Structure: BOS, CHoCH & Swing Points',
    metaDesc: 'Understand ICT market structure using swing highs and lows, Break of Structure (BOS), and Change of Character (CHoCH), with rules for defining and testing each pattern.',
