        'Some models compare directional displacement with overlapping pullbacks. These are descriptive features rather than universal separators; define the body, overlap and follow-through measures and count counterexamples.',
        'Some traders test whether a selected PD Array or prior reference changes reversal outcomes. Neither reversal nor retracement requires a named zone, and the label itself does not establish a higher probability.',
